	<section_number>15.2-2007</section_number>
	<catch_line>Fee for processing application under § 15.2-2006</catch_line>
	<text>
		The governing body of any locality may prescribe and charge a reasonable fee not exceeding $100 for processing an application pursuant to § 15.2-2006.
	</text>
	<history>1970, c. 161, § 15.1-364.1; 1976, c. 183; 1979, c. 208; 1997, c. 587.</history>
